[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 5641.07, "timestamp": "01:34:01", "text": "ええと、これです。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5645.39, "timestamp": "01:34:05", "text": "つまり、ここで数えるということです。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5650.03, "timestamp": "01:34:10", "text": "わかった。何個ありますか？それは、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5653.83, "timestamp": "01:34:13", "text": "アイテム。待って。贈り物できますか"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5656.79, "timestamp": "01:34:16", "text": "複数の会員権をプレゼントできるんですよね？わかった。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5657.55, "timestamp": "01:34:17", "text": "それで"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5675.189, "timestamp": "01:34:35", "text": "えっと、会員制度ってどういう仕組みなんですか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5676.27, "timestamp": "01:34:36", "text": "会員"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5681.35, "timestamp": "01:34:41", "text": "贈り物。金額を自由に設定できますか？いいえ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5684.07, "timestamp": "01:34:44", "text": "会員数が29人であることに満足しています"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5687.27, "timestamp": "01:34:47", "text": "ルピー。 58か"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5690.709, "timestamp": "01:34:50", "text": "何か。安くてよかった。だから、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5692.87, "timestamp": "01:34:52", "text": "それだけの価値があると思いますか？ 5人くらい"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5696.11, "timestamp": "01:34:56", "text": "会員費は145ルピーくらいです。それは"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 5698.76, "timestamp": "01:34:58", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh_SFtAZe4NL2w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "mhm"}]